# Frontend Environment Variables Configuration

# API Base URL for backend server communication
# - For Local Development: Leave blank or set to /api to use Vite dev proxy (http://localhost:5000)
# - For Production (Vercel): Set this in Vercel Settings > Environment Variables to your deployed backend URL
#   Example: VITE_API_URL=https://placementgps-server.onrender.com/api
VITE_API_URL=/api
